{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月11日，中國汽車工業協會（以下簡稱「中汽協」）發佈10月汽車工業產銷數據。10月，汽車市場「內冷外熱」的運行態勢仍在延續。國內市場需求釋放不足，汽車出口保持較強韌性，新能源汽車銷量佔比進一步提升。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585982.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:51:20.385327+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:36:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:39.679313+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:39.679313+00:00","content_hash":"bec0e6e851bae8561cf9f5fa1a3892392eae5529007567bfc86402295bdc7b80","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}